[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrsnu/band/issues/comments/1371646707","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsnu/band/pull/226#issuecomment-1371646707","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrsnu/band/issues/226","id":1371646707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEYExeM5Rwarz","user":{"login":"dostos","id":9090115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTAxMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9090115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dostos","html_url":"https://github.com/dostos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dostos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dostos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dostos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dostos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dostos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dostos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dostos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dostos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dostos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-05T01:49:04Z","updated_at":"2023-01-05T01:49:04Z","body":"> LGTM! Except that the tests on this branch all seem to fail. Am I doing something wrong, or is this expected behavior?\r\n\r\nCould you please specify which setting you failed (env, command, ...) and log? I have tested on our docker, Windows, and Android (pixel 4) with an automated script `script/run_test.py`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrsnu/band/issues/comments/1371646707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrsnu/band/issues/comments/1371849230","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsnu/band/pull/226#issuecomment-1371849230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrsnu/band/issues/226","id":1371849230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEYExeM5RxMIO","user":{"login":"juimdpp","id":60267222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjY3MjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60267222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juimdpp","html_url":"https://github.com/juimdpp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juimdpp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juimdpp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juimdpp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juimdpp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juimdpp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juimdpp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juimdpp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juimdpp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juimdpp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-05T06:59:38Z","updated_at":"2023-01-05T06:59:38Z","body":"It was a compilation error that happened because of lines [190](https://github.com/mrsnu/band/blob/5af78b1644f77069b5f128bcc14f896cc65d8f5f/band/model_analyzer.cc#L190), [258](https://github.com/mrsnu/band/blob/5af78b1644f77069b5f128bcc14f896cc65d8f5f/band/model_analyzer.cc#L258), [275 ](https://github.com/mrsnu/band/blob/5af78b1644f77069b5f128bcc14f896cc65d8f5f/band/model_analyzer.cc#L275)of `model_analyzer.cc`. They were returning a tuple using copy-list-initialization, which is forbidden up until [N4387](https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg21/docs/papers/2015/n4387.html). This change is included in g++ only starting from version 6 but I was building with g++ 5.5.0 ([ref](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/compiler_support/17#C.2B.2B17_library_features)). I tried again with the docker environment and it worked perfectly! \r\nSorry for the confusion.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrsnu/band/issues/comments/1371849230/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]